      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "RAG Engineering & Optimization",
      "items": [
        "800-char semantic chunking preserves full project, technical skills, and experience sections intact",
        "Ingestion deduplication purges obsolete vectors on re-upload to eliminate duplicate vector crowding",
        "Retrieval deduplication & Top-8 expansion ensures unique semantic segments reach the prompt context",
        "Matryoshka Representation Learning: Locks vector output dimensionality to 768-d to align with pgvector schema"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Enterprise Resilience",
      "items": [
        "Groq Cloud LPU acceleration delivers sub-400ms time-to-first-token (30x faster than cloud GPU)",
